# This directory is Claude Code's runtime home (~/.claude): it accumulates
# credentials, session state, history, caches, plugins, backups and telemetry.
# This repo only versions a handful of config files, so ignore everything by
# default and explicitly allow back what belongs in the repo. Anything Claude
# Code writes here in the future stays ignored without further edits.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/skills/
